    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6" data-aos="zoom-in">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Siap membangun kesuksesan serupa?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mb-10 text-lg">Mari diskusikan bagaimana kami bisa mengarsiteki ide Anda menjadi kenyataan digital yang <span class="italic">scalable</span>.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg shadow-teal-500/30 hover:bg-slate-900 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
            Mulai Proyek Anda <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
